    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>A high-performance multicore amplifier system that significantly increases the destructive output of both tech and biotic powers. The module includes a dedicated power draw circuit that prioritizes ability generation over secondary suit functions when activated, ensuring maximum energy delivery to the field effect. Grants a +2 item bonus to ability/spell damage rolls (tech and biotic powers).</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> - Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p><hr/><p><em>Installation: Drag it onto armor in your inventory to install it. Its bonus applies while the armor it is installed in is worn. The +2 is added to the damage your biotic and tech powers deal.</em></p>"
